{"title": "Houndmaster's Prey (Condition)", "pageid": 28226, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Houndmaster's_Prey_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark Quarry Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Houndmaster's Prey</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity receives -3 to its <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a></li>\n<li>When a Houndmaster's dog (<a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>) hits the target, it gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prey Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prey_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Prey Essence (Condition)\">Prey Essence</a>, gaining 30 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/BringIntoCombat\" title=\"Status properties/BringIntoCombat\">BringIntoCombat</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Houndmaster.27s_Prey\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Houndmaster's_Prey